 (269606,"wait (chakah, negated)","disposition","the fathers","fail to wait","for God's counsel",GOD,"paired with forgetting","v13: 'they did not WAIT (chakah) for his counsel' - the impatience that would not trust God's timing."),
 (269609,"wanton (taavah)","disposition","the fathers","have a wanton craving","in the wilderness",IB,"paired with the craving and the testing","v14: 'But they had a WANTON (taavah) craving in the wilderness' - the fierce appetite that ruled them, desire become idolatry."),
