 (269613,"test (nasah)","action","the fathers","test / put to proof","God in the desert",GOD,"paired with the craving","v14: 'and put God to the TEST (nasah) in the desert' - the presumptuous trying of God born of appetite."),
 (269616,"ask (sheelah)","action","the fathers","ask / demand","what they craved",GOD,"paired with the craving God granted","v15: 'He gave them what they ASKED (sheelah)' - the demand God met, granting their request but sending leanness."),
