 (269726,"pour out (shaphak)","action","the fathers","pour out","innocent blood",IB,"paired with sacrificing their children","v38: 'they POURED OUT (shaphak) innocent blood, the blood of their sons and daughters' - the shedding of innocent blood, murder as worship."),
